      ro: "Walt Disney World este un element remarcabil al geografiei si culturii americane. Cel mai mare complex de parcuri tematice din lume, în Orlando, Florida. Parcul Magic Kingdom. Epcot. Animal Kingdom. Aceasta arie protejata face parte din bogata fauna si flora a SUA, de la Muntii Stancosi si Apalasi, prin Marile Lacuri, pana la deserturile si zonele subtropicale din Florida. Asemenea multor locuri importante din SUA, acesta imbina particularitatile regionale cu semnificatia nationala — de la mostenirea industriala si agricultura Vestului Mijlociu pana la centrele IT din jurul Silicon Valley. Astfel, acest loc contribuie la profilul variat al Statelor Unite.",
      en: "Walt Disney World Resort in Bay Lake and Lake Buena Vista, Florida, is the largest and most visited entertainment resort complex in the entire world. Masterminded by Walt Disney in the 1960s to supplement Disneyland in California, the enormous 25,000-acre property opened its doors on October 1, 1971, with the iconic Magic Kingdom and its towering Cinderella Castle. The sprawling resort has since massively expanded to encompass four distinct major theme parks—including Epcot, Disney's Hollywood Studios, and Disney's Animal Kingdom—as well as two water parks, dozens of themed hotels, and extensive retail districts. Drawing over 58 million annual visitors, it is an absolute titan of the global tourism economy. Geography K7 — tourism and commercial geography."
